      "description": "Comma Serif is the final chapter of the Comma trilogy, a superfamily of three closely connected typefaces (Base, Sans, & Serif), each with its own voice. Where Base sets the personality, Sans pairs expressive character with formal geometric stroke endings. Comma Serif carries the warmth and angularity of Comma Base, while adding strong serifs, classical proportions, and a true italic with calligraphic details. Its powerful uniwidth design is highly valued by designers who switch weights without disturbing the flow. Comma Serif is a workhorse with character!",
